# An sdist is what somebody installs, not the whole workshop.
#
# `research/` is 668 files and 16 MB — the probes and raw measurements the design
# was made from.  It is provenance for documents rather than source for the
# package, and it is 96% of an sdist that is otherwise under 300 KB.  It stays in
# the repository, which is where somebody who wants it can read it beside the
# history explaining what it was for.
prune research

# Names the project's tracker — the connection, the workspace and the project.
# It is not a credential and it belongs in the repository, but it is of no use
# whatever to somebody installing this.
exclude .subroutine
